      "section": "内十八格-六阴朝阳格",
      "text": "内十八格 - 六阴朝阳格",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c113:p0002",
      "sha256": "4714b12c8c8bf584141feb41f72bb80302396c8aa25c2c55222d2ffc081961e9"
    },
    {
      "section": "内十八格-六阴朝阳格",
      "text": "喜行西方，东南次之，最忌北方。此格以六辛日为主，用丙火为正官，喜逢戊土，戊来动丙，辛日得官星。子字则要一位，多则不冲。若四柱中有丙字、丁字、午字，则冲子不中，减分数，大运亦同。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c113:p0003",
      "sha256": "bfca80efd299bf4ed3ee4ee1d1354cee5696727bdfa16fd728ed8e8cfa7d8743"
    },
    {
      "section": "内十八格-六阴朝阳格",
      "text": "知院，",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c113:p0004",
      "sha256": "db151d827f0b2862ce0c027fd384a5030396d157206ec4b3d0cc35825c8f918d"
    },
    {
      "section": "内十八格-六阴朝阳格",
      "text": "戊辰 辛酉 戊子 丙辰",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c113:p0005",
      "sha256": "f4b6103d323bca09a01cc3f352beff90de650470333e315b18dec91db57bc66b"
    },
    {
      "section": "内十八格-六阴朝阳格",
      "text": "太尉，",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c113:p0006",
      "sha256": "6e5d157e2cb50c9bf6767b431c50850e7a7431e42c39165f22cfd0d85cba27ae"
    },
    {
      "section": "内十八格-六阴朝阳格",
      "text": "戊辰 辛酉 辛丑 戊子",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c113:p0007",
      "sha256": "4da1ad938c589f61fe3a2b2ebc6f05802d933bf72cf9a012a891bd40328c1d5f"
    },
    {
      "section": "内十八格-六阴朝阳格",
      "text": "眉批：辛逢戊子最相宜，名利高登折高枝，四季秋生无亥子，荣华富贵正为奇。",
      "layer": "historical_commentary",
